data: {"id": "498d6ab8ec694cec-thinking-parallel_evidence-1217", "run_id": "498d6ab8ec694cec", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n### 实体身份\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-v06/workload`，UID `f0ed729b-e64a-4bd6-8065-3af3efc737f8`，调度到 `node2` (10.2.0.50)，单容器 `app`。\n- **状态**: `Pending` / `ContainerCreating`，已持续约 81 分钟（creationTimestamp: 2026-09-11T11:38:17Z）。\n\n### 根因证据（已确认）\n\n**根因: HostPath 卷挂载失败**。核心证据来自两个 Warning 级别事件：\n\n1. **`FailedMount`**（5m47s 前，重复 45 次，跨越 81 分钟）:\n   ```\n   MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : hostPath type check failed: \n   /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input is not a directory\n   `", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789131579543, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

